WEBVTT

NOTE Machine translated from English captions; target=zu.

1
00:00:03.860 --> 00:00:09.970
Le vidiyo inikeza isingeniso esifushane kudivayisi ye-Arclight.

2
00:00:09.970 --> 00:00:18.220
Uma isinamathiselwe, i-sideshole ye-ophthalmoscope eqondile izobekwa ngqo phezu kwe

3
00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:26.469
indawo emaphakathi ilensi esetshenziswa ikhamera yakho yeselula kwimodi yevidiyo.

4
00:00:26.469 --> 00:00:31.051
Ikhamera izosebenza njengamehlo akho

5
00:00:31.051 --> 00:00:35.634
lapho ubuka ngembobo eseceleni.

6
00:00:35.634 --> 00:00:40.217
Ukuqinisekisa ukuthi iyiphi ilensi okufanele uyilandele

7
00:00:40.217 --> 00:00:44.800
sidehole nge, vula uhlelo lokusebenza lwevidiyo, noma

8
00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:45.653
ifoni yakho.

9
00:00:45.653 --> 00:00:49.067
Beka umunwe wakho phezu kwelensi ngayinye ngokulandelana.

10
00:00:49.067 --> 00:00:52.480
Uma isikrini siba mnyama, umbozile

11
00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:54.660
ilensi esetshenziselwa ividiyo.

12
00:00:54.660 --> 00:00:59.020
Susa iphepha eliphuzi ngemuva kwesiqeshana.

13
00:00:59.020 --> 00:01:01.200
Beka amaphuzu we

14
00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:06.387
umcibisholo ophakathi nendawo yelensi esetshenziselwa ukuthwebula ividiyo.

15
00:01:06.387 --> 00:01:08.745
Cindezela isiqeshana phansi ngokuqinile.

16
00:01:08.745 --> 00:01:10.160
Susa umcibisholo.

17
00:01:10.160 --> 00:01:14.156
isiqeshana manje kufanele sibe sesimweni esifanele.

18
00:01:14.156 --> 00:01:16.820
Ukuze wenze ividiyo i-reflex switch ivuliwe

19
00:01:16.820 --> 00:01:22.300
i-barectophthalboscope, vala izibani zesenzo bese ukhetha ukukhanya okugqama kakhulu

20
00:01:22.300 --> 00:01:23.455
ngokuchofoza kathathu.

21
00:01:23.455 --> 00:01:26.920
Qinisekisa ukuthi i-lens rack iphezulu.

22
00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:28.460
Ngokubheke ukukhanya

23
00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:34.180
kude nefoni uye esigulini, beka izibani zesenzo kusiqeshana bese udonsa

24
00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:37.018
donsa i-elastic ukuze uvikeleke.

25
00:01:37.018 --> 00:01:42.220
Phusha amalambu e-arc phezulu aze angakwazi ukushelela.

26
00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:47.407
Imbobo yesilayidi ye-direct ye-oscilloscope manje izophela ngokuqondile

27
00:01:47.407 --> 00:01:49.260
isikhungo se-lens

28
00:01:49.260 --> 00:01:50.541
ethwebula ividiyo.

29
00:01:50.541 --> 00:01:55.666
Ukuze urekhode iso langaphandle, sebenzisa esinye isiphetho sedivayisi.

30
00:01:55.666 --> 00:01:56.520
Ukuthwebula

31
00:01:56.520 --> 00:02:02.976
isithombe manje, vula uhlelo lokusebenza lwevidiyo futhi usondeze ukugcwalisa isikrini nge

32
00:02:02.976 --> 00:02:04.360
buka nge

33
00:02:04.360 --> 00:02:05.240
ikhaya lesayithi.

34
00:02:05.240 --> 00:02:07.880
Cindezela irekhodi bese wenza ukuhlola.

35
00:02:07.880 --> 00:02:10.520
Cindezela okuthi misa bese ulondoloza ividiyo.

36
00:02:10.520 --> 00:02:17.640
Manje usungabelana nozakwenu ezinkundleni ezivikelekile ezibethelwe kuphela ngenjongo yakho

37
00:02:17.640 --> 00:02:29.460
zuza umqondo ezigulini.

38
00:02:29.460 --> 00:02:45.220
Jabulela ukusebenzisa izibani zesenzo emsebenzini wami.
